{"id":"ad60b464ec6e147e","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Connected Graph","display":"df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph — ZFC Comb6 Connected Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph — ZFC Comb6 Connected Graph","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-connected]]","[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-connected-graph — ZFC Comb6 Connected Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71801f5b9407391a\" href=\"?note=71801f5b9407391a\" title=\"58-df-connected\">58-df-connected</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (vertex set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq[X]^2\">\\(E\\subseteq[X]^2\\)</span> (edge set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in X\">\\(x,y\\in X\\)</span> (vertices bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (path length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\gamma\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)\\)</span> (finite path witness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(n-1)=y\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(i+1\\in n\\to\\{\\gamma(i),\\gamma(i+1)\\}\\in E)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(n-1)=y\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(i+1\\in n\\to\\{\\gamma(i),\\gamma(i+1)\\}\\in E)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The empty graph is excluded; paths are finite nonempty vertex sequences.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-connected","status":"resolved","id":"71801f5b9407391a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-connected]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\gamma\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)$ (finite path witness, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq[X]^2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}connected\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6ConnectedGraph}_S(X,E)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\varnothing\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\gamma,n,X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(n-1)=y\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(i+1\\in n\\to\\{\\gamma(i),\\gamma(i+1)\\}\\in E)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1181,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1671","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[